      ],
      "description": "<p>When a zombie leshy dies, a burst of twisted primal void energy explodes from its body, restoring <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> Hit Points to each undead fungi or plant creature in a 30 foot emanation and killing all natural plants, though merely causing discomfort to creatures with the plant trait. This area is filled with rotten vegetation, becoming difficult terrain.</p>",
